/target
# The UI harnesses build nested fixture crates under the crate they run from, so
# rstorch-derive/target appears whenever the derive suite runs. Its cleanup is
# skipped when the pinned-toolchain assertion panics first, which left an
# untracked directory that root-anchored /target does not cover.
target/
Cargo.lock
!tools/compile-cost/**/Cargo.lock
/.test_cache
/data
.DS_Store
